msgstr "``is_extend_command=False`` (デフォルト) の場合、生の TCP プロトコルのみが起動されます。"

#: ../../source/Instance_Setup/Instance_Setup.rst:290
#: fbbe2f02d9174359baca2c685704b475
msgid ""
"Independently of ``is_extend_command``, every launch also loads the "
