#: ../../source/Instance_Setup/Instance_Setup.rst:299
#: 1ec730c995b1454da1b208331d9ca8fe
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``True`` (default) – the instance's own start method "
"(``start_TCP_Server()`` / ``start_TCP_client()``) runs and keeps its "
"console input loop in the foreground."
msgstr ""
"'' True '' (デフォルト) – '' START_TCP_SERVER ()''/'' START_TCP_CLIENT "
